4️⃣ TCP vs UDP 🔥🔥🔥

One of the most common interview questions.

TCP	UDP

Connection-oriented	Connectionless
Reliable	Best-effort
Slower	Faster
Ordered delivery	No ordering guarantee
Error recovery	Limited recovery mechanisms
Used for web/file transfer	Used for streaming/DNS/real-time use cases


🧠 Simple Rule

> Need reliability → TCP
Need low latency → UDP




